  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One URL, two protocols",
      "items": [
        "aspen-mdm-checkin routes to check-in, aspen-mdm to the command handler",
        "Anything else is a 415; another method is a 405; an unknown enrollment is a 403, never a 401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Extension without coupling",
      "items": [
        "A hook can veto an operation before it runs, and the veto becomes a 403",
        "The DDM engine attaches as a DMHandler, which is why service never imports ddm"
      ]
    }
  ]
